<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Big Meadows Loop</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:168-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.174662" lon="-121.679190"><ele>1100.7</ele><name>Skyline Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:skyline-sno-park (OSM way 148323441); confidence: high; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 3640; quote: map 38: SKYLINE SNO-PARK 3640'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.120312" lon="-121.706205"><ele>1103.0</ele><name>Road 42 / Road 260 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 37563808, start of the 'S-42N Road' track, about 0.65 mi south of the Road 58 junction (OSM node 37537779); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: ski 0.6 mile beyond the Road 58 turnoff to Little Crater Meadow, then turn off Road 42 onto Road 260</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.104596" lon="-121.704379"><ele>1060.6</ele><name>Side road to the meadow</name><desc>source: OSM node 2489997839 on 'S-42N Road', 1.40 mi along it from Road 42; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: Big Meadows is 1.4 miles from Road 42 and is hidden from view by a narrow band of trees. A short side road through this band suddenly opens onto a magnificent scene</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.099950" lon="-121.703230"><ele>1059.1</ele><name>Big Meadows, north edge</name><desc>source: GNIS Big Meadows (geonames find); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 3450; quote: map 38: BIG MEADOWS 3450'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.097000" lon="-121.708000"><ele>1055.7</ele><name>Big Meadows (map 38 star)</name><desc>source: placed on the meadow floor (DEM 3,464 ft, flat) where map 38 draws its star, inside the meadow's upper arm; OSM wetland node 369015548 lies 0.5 mi farther SW; confidence: low; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 3450; quote: As you ski along the edge of the meadow, the scene changes</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.095000" lon="-121.716000"><ele>1061.3</ele><name>Meadow west arm</name><desc>source: placed in the meadow's narrowing west arm, from map 38; confidence: low; pdf_page: 170; quote: ski south in the meadow then westward as it curves and narrows</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.098172" lon="-121.723196"><ele>1059.6</ele><name>Primitive road north of the meadow's west end</name><desc>source: OSM node 2489997641 on 'S-42N Road' west of the meadow; confidence: low; pdf_page: 170; quote: Leave the meadow, ski north to a nearby primitive road, and turn left following it</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.100724" lon="-121.730237"><ele>1056.3</ele><name>West end of OSM 'S-42N Road' way 5304597</name><desc>source: OSM node 2489997499; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: turn left following it to Road 42</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.101855" lon="-121.731216"><ele>1056.9</ele><name>South end of OSM 'S-42N Road' way 5304598</name><desc>source: OSM way 5304598 end, 150 m from the other piece; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: following it to Road 42</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.106013" lon="-121.735506"><ele>1064.6</ele><name>Primitive road meets Road 42</name><desc>source: OSM node 37454284 (way 5304598 on Road 42); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: following it to Road 42. Turn south (left) 0.3 mile</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.104786" lon="-121.741517"><ele>1040.9</ele><name>Road 42 at the road on the right</name><desc>source: OSM node 37454255 on Road 42, 0.3 mi west of the last; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: then pick up a road on the right</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.105027" lon="-121.741904"><ele>1042.3</ele><name>Start of OSM 'S-42 Road' (Road 270)</name><desc>source: OSM node 2489161009, start of way 241219137 (USFS 4200270); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: This forest road climbs gently to a large clearcut area</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.114113" lon="-121.708345"><ele>1092.6</ele><name>Road 270 meets Road 42</name><desc>source: OSM node 37454407, end of way 241219137 on Road 42; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: eventually leading back on Road 270 to Road 42</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.174662" lon="-121.679190"><ele>1100.7</ele><name>Skyline Sno-Park (finish)</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:skyline-sno-park (OSM way 148323441); confidence: high; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 3640; quote: map 38: SKYLINE SNO-PARK 3640'</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Big Meadows Loop</name><desc>1. Skyline Sno-Park -&gt; Road 42 / Road 260 junction: osm (high), 4.52 mi | 2. Road 42 / Road 260 junction -&gt; Side road to the meadow: osm (medium), 1.40 mi | 3. Side road to the meadow -&gt; Big Meadows, north edge: straight (low), 0.33 mi | 4. Big Meadows, north edge -&gt; Big Meadows (map 38 star): straight (low), 0.31 mi | 5. Big Meadows (map 38 star) -&gt; Meadow west arm: straight (low), 0.41 mi | 6. Meadow west arm -&gt; Primitive road north of the meadow's west end: straight (low), 0.41 mi | 7. Primitive road north of the meadow's west end -&gt; West end of OSM 'S-42N Road' way 5304597: osm (medium), 0.41 mi | 8. West end of OSM 'S-42N Road' way 5304597 -&gt; South end of OSM 'S-42N Road' way 5304598: straight (medium), 0.09 mi | 9. South end of OSM 'S-42N Road' way 5304598 -&gt; Primitive road meets Road 42: osm (medium), 0.51 mi | 10. Primitive road meets Road 42 -&gt; Road 42 at the road on the right: osm (medium), 0.35 mi | 11. Road 42 at the road on the right -&gt; Start of OSM 'S-42 Road' (Road 270): straight (medium), 0.03 mi | 12. Start of OSM 'S-42 Road' (Road 270) -&gt; Road 270 meets Road 42: osm (medium), 2.61 mi | 13. Road 270 meets Road 42 -&gt; Skyline Sno-Park (finish): osm (high), 4.98 mi</desc>
